{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Commit one store unit by closure (the resolver's write side): resolves lib+ctl in the LIVE store, gathers the control record and every id-prefixed sibling (facets, _patches journal), each command record with its typed impls and their attachments, timer/event components, the controls index, and the generated newbound_core/src/<lib>/<ctl>/ sources - PLUS every path dev.git.store_status reports under this unit, which is what brings in deletions the closure walk cannot see (a removed facet, attachment or legacy _patches journal) and the unit's generated sources in a library repo's own crate. Stages exactly those paths (add -A --) and commits with a pathspec (commit -m msg -- paths), so nothing of the unit is overlooked and pre-staged unrelated work stays staged, untouched. A command or control REMOVED from the store no longer belongs to any unit: store_status reports its files under the bare library group - commit those with dev.git.commit_paths. Returns {unit, control_id, staged, skipped, committed, out}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"},{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"message","type":"String"},{"name":"author","type":"String"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"rgkipv1a05d34ad79m3","readers":[],"time":1794329346187,"username":"system","writers":[]}